      "is": "IS 2016:1967",
      "clause": "1",
      "title": "Scope – Requirements for",
      "text": "1. Scope - Requirements for plain washers of the following types : a) Machined washers, for precision and semiprecision grade of general purpose bolts and screws, in diameter range 1.7 to 155 mm. b) Punched washers, Type A, for black grade general purpose bolts and screws, in diameter range 1.8 to 52 mm. c) Punched washers, Type B, for slotted head screws, in diameter range 7.8 to 22 mm.",
